        # The join. A post-image whose blob the tip's tree holds is set aside
        # first: the tip half judged it. For a one-parent commit, a post-image
        # the pair verdict calls binary is a candidate, unless it is a pure
        # rename whose new path the addition verdict calls text; a type change
        # is a candidate when the addition verdict of its new object calls it
        # binary, the pair verdict set aside. For a merge, a post-image whose
        # section prints Binary is a candidate and one with a hunk is not; one
        # with neither is a rename candidate judged by the addition verdict of
        # its new path, or, being no rename, a candidate when it has a section
